    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Conifer is a mid-sized wooden play station with activity panels at ground level and slides up top. A blue double slide lets two children go down side by side, and a separate red slide gives a third way out. To reach the deck, children use a climbing panel and cross a rope ladder bridge. The ground-level panels give younger or less confident children something to do without climbing. Conifer takes 20 to 25 children and needs a product area of 20'9\" x 16'7\", with a safe play area of 26'9\" x 22'7\". Listed skills include self-directed play, strength, flexibility, hand and eye coordination and confidence. It suits preschools, society gardens and the junior section of a school. The galvanised frame, moulded slides and panels, laminates and rope are under warranty for 3 years. Ask us for a drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
